{"id":"d8b4548588dec7bd","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-gl-incompactness.md","title":"Failure of Compactness for GL Frames","display":"ex-gl-incompactness — Failure of Compactness for GL Frames","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-gl-incompactness","aliases":["89-ex-gl-incompactness"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"ex-gl-incompactness — Failure of Compactness for GL Frames","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]","[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-gl-incompactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-gl-incompactness</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-gl-incompactness — Failure of Compactness for GL Frames"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38f802289559e5da\" href=\"?note=38f802289559e5da\" title=\"89-df-modal-consistent-set\">89-df-modal-consistent-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" href=\"?note=e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" title=\"89-df-modal-iteration\">89-df-modal-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\">\\((p_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 为互异命题字母，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 是 GL 定理集。</li>\n<li>模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\">\\(M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\\)</span> 的框架记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_M\">\\(F_M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 为局部真值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为局部一致性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,U_n\">\\(U,U_n\\)</span> 是下文定义的模态公式集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}\\)</span> 为传递逆良基框架条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}incompactness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nU&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Diamond p_0\\}\\cup\\{\\Box(p_i\\to\\Diamond p_{i+1})\\mid i\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nU_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Diamond p_0\\}\\cup\\{\\Box(p_i\\to\\Diamond p_{i+1})\\mid i&lt;n\\}\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists M,w\\;\n(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F_M)\\land |W_M|=n+2\\land w\\in W_M\\land\n\\forall A\\in U_n\\;M,w\\models A),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(U),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall M\\;\\forall w\\in W_M\\;\n(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F_M)\\to\\exists A\\in U\\;M,w\\not\\models A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}incompactness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nU&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Diamond p_0\\}\\cup\\{\\Box(p_i\\to\\Diamond p_{i+1})\\mid i\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nU_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Diamond p_0\\}\\cup\\{\\Box(p_i\\to\\Diamond p_{i+1})\\mid i&lt;n\\}\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists M,w\\;\n(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F_M)\\land |W_M|=n+2\\land w\\in W_M\\land\n\\forall A\\in U_n\\;M,w\\models A),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(U),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall M\\;\\forall w\\in W_M\\;\n(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F_M)\\to\\exists A\\in U\\;M,w\\not\\models A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 102；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 的见证：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\">\\(W=\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xRy\\iff x&lt;y\">\\(xRy\\iff x&lt;y\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(p_i)=\\{i+1\\}\">\\(V(p_i)=\\{i+1\\}\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\le n\">\\(i\\le n\\)</span>，其他字母赋空，根为 0。关系传递非自反，各所需菱形沿下一点见证。任一有限子集包含于某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span>；由 GL 可靠性，有限可满足保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 局部一致。\n若全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 在某 GL 模型的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 真，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\{x\\in W:wRx\\land\\exists i\\;M,x\\models p_i\\}\">\\(X=\\{x\\in W:wRx\\land\\exists i\\;M,x\\models p_i\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond p_0\">\\(\\Diamond p_0\\)</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 非空；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span> 由对应盒公式得到后继 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{i+1}\">\\(p_{i+1}\\)</span>，传递性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in X\">\\(y\\in X\\)</span>。所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 每个元素均有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 内后继，直接违反逆良基性。这个集合论证明不用从各见证额外选择一条无限链。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-consistent-set","status":"resolved","id":"38f802289559e5da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0157f8bea9275cf1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(p_i)_{i\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)","display":false},{"tex":"F_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"U,U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}incompactness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nU&\\coloneqq\\{\\Diamond p_0\\}\\cup\\{\\Box(p_i\\to\\Diamond p_{i+1})\\mid i\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nU_n&\\coloneqq\\{\\Diamond p_0\\}\\cup\\{\\Box(p_i\\to\\Diamond p_{i+1})\\mid i<n\\}\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\\\\n&\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists M,w\\;\n(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F_M)\\land |W_M|=n+2\\land w\\in W_M\\land\n\\forall A\\in U_n\\;M,w\\models A),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(U),\\\\\n&\\forall M\\;\\forall w\\in W_M\\;\n(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F_M)\\to\\exists A\\in U\\;M,w\\not\\models A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"xRy\\iff x<y","display":false},{"tex":"V(p_i)=\\{i+1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\{x\\in W:wRx\\land\\exists i\\;M,x\\models p_i\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond p_0","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"p_{i+1}","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":2073,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"不紧性：[[89-ex-gl-incompactness]]。"}],"outgoing":["38f802289559e5da","e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","c6ab46cd662b1409","0157f8bea9275cf1"]}